            "version": 0,
            "source": "broker",
            "description": "The answer of the container: the top-level code **0** - the controller did look at the request - and the per-feature code **42** (`InvalidRequest`) with *\"Could not apply finalized feature update because the provided feature is not supported.\"* A ZooKeeper-backed Kafka 2.8.2 broker supports **no feature at all**, so this is the answer to every feature name, not only to a nonsensical one.",
