            "description": "UpdateFeatures **v1** (KIP-778): the finalized `metadata.version` of the node is raised to the level 21 it already has, with the `upgrade_type` **1** (`UPGRADE`) in the place of the `allow_downgrade` boolean of the version 0 and the new top-level `validate_only` **true** behind the update array. The controller is asked what it would do and told to write nothing.",
