            "class": "Protocol\\Kafka\\Protocol\\Request\\UpdateFeaturesRequest",
            "version": 1,
            "source": "broker",
            "description": "The `upgrade_type` **2** (`SAFE_DOWNGRADE`) of KIP-778: the finalized `metadata.version` is to be lowered from 21 to 20, and only as far as the controller can do it without losing metadata. `validate_only` is **true**, because a real downgrade of the metadata version of the node is a change of the cluster this repository does not make.",
